It might be easier to opt-out from creating a runtime chunk for this entry at all.

``` js
		compiler.hooks.thisCompilation.tap("...", compilation => {
			compilation.hooks.addEntry.tap(
				"...",
				(_, { name: entryName }) => {
					if (entryName !== "name-of-mf-entry") return;
					const data = compilation.entries.get(entryName);
					data.options.runtime = undefined;
				}
			);
		});
```

